TI  - Judge Decoding: Faster Speculative Sampling Requires Going Beyond Model Alignment
AU  - Gregor Bachmann
AU  - Sotiris Anagnostidis
AU  - Albert Pumarola
AU  - Markos Georgopoulos
AU  - Artsiom Sanakoyeu
AU  - Yuming Du
