TI  - MIA-DPO: Multi-Image Augmented Direct Preference Optimization For Large Vision-Language Models
AU  - Ziyu Liu
AU  - Yuhang Zang
AU  - Xiaoyi Dong
AU  - Pan Zhang
AU  - Yuhang Cao
AU  - Haodong Duan
AU  - Conghui He
AU  - Yuanjun Xiong
